[
  {
    "block_type": 3,
    "text": "Privacy Guard 插件化设计与发布"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 4,
    "text": "概述"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "Privacy Guard 是一个为 OpenClaw 设计的多用户隐私隔离框架，现已抽象为通用插件，支持独立发布和安装。本插件提供上下文感知的知识访问控制、输出审查、知识标记和内存过滤功能，专为多用户群聊场景设计。"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 4,
    "text": "插件架构设计"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 5,
    "text": "1. 核心组件"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "#### 1.1 PrivacyContext（隐私上下文）"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**功能**：基于聊天上下文（私聊/群聊）控制知识访问权限"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**规则**："
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  - 私聊（1人）：可访问该用户的所有知识（公开+私有）"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  - 群聊（2+人）：只能访问所有参与者的公开知识"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**实现**：`privacy_context.py`"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "#### 1.2 PrivacyReviewer（输出审查器）"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**功能**：发送前检测消息中的隐私泄露"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**检测层**："
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  1. 规则匹配（快速）：正则表达式匹配私有信息模式"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  2. LLM自审（可选）：处理规则无法覆盖的复杂情况"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**实现**：`privacy_review.py`"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "#### 1.3 KnowledgeStore（知识存储）"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**功能**：存储和管理带分类标记的知识条目"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**格式**：JSONL 文件，按用户/可见性组织"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**标记**：每条知识单独标记为 public/private"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "**实现**：`knowledge_store.py`"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 5,
    "text": "2. 插件接口"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "#### 2.1 配置接口"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "{"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  \"enabled\": true,"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  \"review\": {"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "    \"enabled\": true,"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "    \"llm_self_review\": false,"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "    \"block_on_violation\": true"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  },"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  \"knowledge_base\": {"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "    \"path\": \"./privacy/knowledge\","
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "    \"auto_tag\": true"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  },"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  \"defaults\": {"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "    \"visibility\": \"private\","
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "    \"always_private_categories\": ["
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "      \"calendar\", \"family\", \"finance\", \"health\","
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "      \"auth\", \"contact_private\", \"dm_content\""
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "    ]"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "  }"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "}"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "#### 2.2 工具接口"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "`privacyContext`：获取当前隐私上下文和可访问知识"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "`privacyReview`：审查消息中的隐私违规"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "`addKnowledge`：添加知识条目到存储"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 2,
    "text": "#### 2.3 钩子接口"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "`session:init`：会话初始化时注入隐私上下文"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "`message:beforeSend`：发送前审查消息"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "`memory:search`：过滤内存搜索结果"
  },
  {
    "block_type": 12,
    "text": "`file:read`：控制文件读取权限"
  },
  {
